<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.burakgon.Envelope</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <name>Envelope</name>
  <summary>Fast, beautiful mail and calendar</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.burakgon">
    <name>Envelope contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Envelope is a mail and calendar app for Linux that feels instant. Everything is stored
      locally, so opening, searching and organizing mail never waits for the network.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Gmail, Microsoft 365, Outlook.com, Exchange, iCloud, Yahoo, Fastmail and any IMAP server</li>
      <li>Unified inbox, conversations, split inbox and lightning-fast full-text search</li>
      <li>Calendar with CalDAV, Google Calendar, Microsoft 365 and Exchange, including invitations</li>
      <li>Contacts synced with CardDAV, Google and Microsoft 365</li>
      <li>Keyboard shortcuts for everything, command palette, undo send, snooze and send later</li>
      <li>Rules, templates and reminders when nobody replies</li>
      <li>Privacy first: remote images and trackers blocked by default</li>
      <li>Optional AI assistance with your own provider (OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama and more)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.burakgon.Envelope.desktop</launchable>
